                        "entry_id": "a768538b-1720-3f09-bb9f-d1beb4eb96cd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The section of a primary school for the education of older children, typically the years (grades) three to six."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Australia",
                            "UK"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
